Le Ja Tu Kahin guitar chords with strumming pattern sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Le Ja Tu Kahin.

Le [D#m]jaa tu [B]kahin,        [F#]mere [C#]saathiya
Koi [D#m]khwahish [B]nahi,        [F#]tujhko jo paa [C#] liya

Chal [F#] chale ab ye [B]kadam,        [F#]Laage na darr [C#]sanam
[D#m]Jannat ke [B]kaafile,        sang [F#]tere le [C#]chalun

Aa [D#m]le jaa [B]kahin,        [F#]mere [C#]saathiya

[D#m]Ho…[B]…[F#]…[C#]

[D#m]Ye kya ho raha hai,        Dil [B]jo tu chhu gaya hai
[C#]Tere ehsaas ka mukammal [F#]ye jahaan mil gaya
[D#m]Palkein bandh kar loon,        Toh [B]dekhun bas tujhiko
[C#]Aankhon ko teri khwabon ka [F#]aashiyan mil gaya

Kho jaaye [G#m]na, ud jaae [F#]na,        Ye [B]pal ab [Bm]haseen
Aa [D#m]le jaa [B]kahin [F#]mere [C#]saathiya

[D#m]Saanson pe likha hai,        Tu [B]jeene ki wajah hai
[C#]Chaahun betahasha [F#]tootkar main toh tujhe

[D#m]Teri rehguzar mein,        Main [B]kab se hoon safar mein
[C#]Jaake theharna hai ab toh [F#]manzil pe mujhe

Tu hai [G#m]jahaan main hoon [F#]wahaan,        Kya [B]aasmaan [Bm]zameen
Aa [D#m]le jaa [B]kahin [F#]mere [C#]saathiya

Wo [D#m]ho..[B]..[F#]..[C#]
